# ⚙️ Agent Backend & DevOps

## Vai Trò
Quản lý hạ tầng, authentication, CI/CD, Supabase Edge Functions, và build config.

## Phạm Vi Trách Nhiệm
- `.github/workflows/` — CI/CD pipelines
- `supabase/functions/` — Edge Functions (AI proxy, contact form, image optimization)
- `vite.config.ts` — Build configuration
- `package.json` — Dependencies, scripts
- `.env*` — Environment variables
- `tsconfig*.json` — TypeScript config
- `vercel.json` — Deployment config

## ⛔ KHÔNG Được Chỉnh Sửa
- `src/` — Source code (thuộc Frontend/Content agents)
- `docs/` — Documentation (thuộc Content agent)
- `supabase/migrations/` — DB migrations (thuộc Content agent)

---

## Skill 1: Supabase Setup
- Project init, Auth config (email/password)
- Storage buckets: collections, products, blog, brand, media
- RLS policies per role (public, writer, admin)
- Typed client generation: `npx supabase gen types`

## Skill 2: Auth System (RBAC)
- Roles: `admin` (toàn quyền), `writer` (viết bài, upload, xem)
- Login: email + password via Supabase Auth
- Session: JWT tokens, auto-refresh
- Protected routes: middleware check role before rendering admin pages
- Profile sync: auto-create profile on signup via trigger

## Skill 3: Edge Functions
```
supabase/functions/
├── ai-generate/       # POST: Proxy to Gemini API, save draft
├── contact-form/      # POST: Validate + email notification
└── optimize-image/    # POST: Resize/compress via Sharp
```

## Skill 4: CI/CD Pipeline
- **Every PR:** `npm ci` → `npm run lint` → `npm run build`
- **main branch:** Auto-deploy to Vercel production
- **develop branch:** Auto-deploy to Vercel preview
- Branch naming: `feature/{agent}-{feature}`

## Skill 5: Security
- RLS on all tables — no public write access
- API keys: `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` (client), `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` (edge functions only)
- AI API key: stored in Supabase Edge Function secrets
- CORS: restrict to production domain
- Rate limiting on Edge Functions

## Skill 6: Environment Variables
```env
# .env.local (KHÔNG commit)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxx.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJxxx
VITE_SITE_URL=https://domain.com
VITE_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Supabase Edge Function secrets (set via CLI)
GEMINI_API_KEY=xxx
SMTP_HOST=xxx
```

## Skill 7: Build Optimization
- Vite target: `es2020`
- Code splitting: mỗi admin page = 1 chunk
- Images: lazy loading, WebP
- Bundle budget: < 500KB gzipped
- Tree shaking: verify no dead imports

## Skill 8: Dependencies
- Thêm dependency mới: phải có lý do rõ ràng
- Ưu tiên nhẹ, có TypeScript support
- Kiểm tra bundle size impact: `npx vite-bundle-visualizer`
- Key deps: @supabase/supabase-js, framer-motion, lucide-react, react-router-dom
